{
  "sn1.35:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 1.35 ",
  "sn1.35:0.2": "4. Satullapakāyikavagga ",
  "sn1.35:0.3": "Ujjhānasaññisutta ",
  "sn1.35:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "sn1.35:1.2": "Atha kho sambahulā ujjhānasaññikā devatāyo abhikkantāya rattiyā abhikkantavaṇṇā kevalakappaṁ jetavanaṁ obhāsetvā yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamiṁsu; upasaṅkamitvā vehāsaṁ aṭṭhaṁsu. ",
  "sn1.35:1.3": "Vehāsaṁ ṭhitā kho ekā devatā bhagavato santike imaṁ gāthaṁ abhāsi: ",
  "sn1.35:2.1": "“Aññathā santamattānaṁ, ",
  "sn1.35:2.2": "aññathā yo pavedaye; ",
  "sn1.35:2.3": "Nikacca kitavasseva, ",
  "sn1.35:2.4": "bhuttaṁ theyyena tassa taṁ. ",
  "sn1.35:3.1": "Yañhi kayirā tañhi vade, ",
  "sn1.35:3.2": "yaṁ na kayirā na taṁ vade; ",
  "sn1.35:3.3": "Akarontaṁ bhāsamānaṁ, ",
  "sn1.35:3.4": "parijānanti paṇḍitā”ti. ",
  "sn1.35:4.1": "“Na yidaṁ bhāsitamattena, ",
  "sn1.35:4.2": "ekantasavanena vā; ",
  "sn1.35:4.3": "Anukkamitave sakkā, ",
  "sn1.35:4.4": "yāyaṁ paṭipadā daḷhā; ",
  "sn1.35:4.5": "Yāya dhīrā pamuccanti, ",
  "sn1.35:4.6": "jhāyino mārabandhanā. ",
  "sn1.35:5.1": "Na ve dhīrā pakubbanti, ",
  "sn1.35:5.2": "viditvā lokapariyāyaṁ; ",
  "sn1.35:5.3": "Aññāya nibbutā dhīrā, ",
  "sn1.35:5.4": "tiṇṇā loke visattikan”ti. ",
  "sn1.35:6.1": "Atha kho tā devatāyo pathaviyaṁ patiṭṭhahitvā bhagavato pādesu sirasā nipati